      "mergeID": "640f6d7e92f95745280594f4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "i have a Rikkorchi avatar and noticed after the 2023.1.2 update that its head won't turn when I look up or down, it likes to move around my hip orientation, both in FBT VR and in desktop mode (demonstrated when walking/running side-to-side)\n\ndue to its relation with its hips the hands become misaligned when I sit in FBT\n\nI've noticed this also happen to one of my favorited public avatars too (listed in the \"reproduction steps\" section)\n\nhere's a video demonstrating the problem\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/695796262087164014/1084018203396685844/bug_demonstration.mp4",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Avatar heads' tracking incorrectly",
