      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It happens for me when a bone with a Physbone script targeting it has multiple child bones. If its 'multi child type' is set to ignore, IK will no longer work, if it is set to average, it will, but then the bone with the script on it will also move when thats not wanted. 'IsAnimated' is set to on in both cases.",
