      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "640b702c26e0a3454593f7c3",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue specifically, since I can't update the post anymore, seems to be that any time a bone is ignored by the setting \"multi-child type: ignore\", that bone is also ignored in the tag \"IsAnimated\".\n\nThis does not only affect IK affected bones, any bone with this configuration will break if physics on it are ignored by multi-child type: ignore.\n\nP.S. I have not tested whether ignoring bones through the ignored transform setting are also affected. It could be that any bone not affected by physics are affected by this bug",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
