      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e069f8fc2c972dd4a0430|full_name}: that'd be since previously on the head bone, since the head bone itself is ignored by multi-child type: ignore, the head could not only animate freely if isAnimated was on, but also not be affected by physbones.\n\nThis update, if something is not affected by physbones, IsAnimated doesn't take effect either. Which breaks the system a lot of people are used to for hair physics, and the only working system for a lot of more in depth avatars",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
